sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Client
    participant US as userservice :8081
    participant PG as PostgreSQL<br/>users
    participant EU as Eureka :8761
    participant AS as activityservice :8082
    participant MA as MongoDB<br/>activities
    participant K as Kafka<br/>activity-topic
    participant AI as aiservice :8083
    participant MR as MongoDB<br/>recommendations
    participant OAI as OpenAI API

    rect rgb(232, 242, 255)
    Note over U,PG: PHASE 1 · SIGN UP — POST /api/users/register
    U->>US: {email, password, firstName, lastName}
    US->>PG: existsByEmailIgnoreCase(email)
    PG-->>US: false
    Note right of US: normalize email · BCrypt hash password<br/>id = UUID · role = USER
    US->>PG: INSERT users (saveAndFlush)
    PG-->>US: saved user
    US-->>U: 201 UserResponse (password never returned)
    end

    rect rgb(232, 250, 238)
    Note over U,US: PHASE 2 · LOGIN — POST /api/users/login
    U->>US: {email, password}
    US->>PG: findByEmailIgnoreCase(email)
    PG-->>US: user + BCrypt hash
    Note right of US: BCrypt.matches<br/>claims: sub=userId, email, role, iat, exp, iss, aud<br/>RS256 signed; refresh token stored hashed
    US-->>U: 200 {accessToken, tokenType="Bearer", expiresInSeconds}
    end

    rect rgb(255, 247, 230)
    Note over U,MA: PHASE 3 · TRACK ACTIVITY — POST /api/activities
    U->>AS: Authorization: Bearer JWT<br/>{userId, type, duration, caloriesBurned, startTime, metrics}
    Note right of AS: JWT verified with public key + issuer/audience<br/>requireSelfOrAdmin: sub == userId OR ROLE_ADMIN
    AS->>EU: resolve USERSERVICE
    EU-->>AS: instance URI
    AS->>US: GET /api/users/{userId}/validate<br/>X-Internal-Api-Key
    US->>PG: existsById(userId)
    PG-->>US: true / false
    alt user not found
        US-->>AS: 200 false
        AS-->>U: 400 Invalid user
    else user exists
        US-->>AS: 200 true
        AS->>MA: save(Activity)
        MA-->>AS: Activity(id, createdAt, updatedAt)
        AS->>K: send(topic=activity-topic, key=userId, value=ActivityEvent JSON)
        Note right of K: acks=all · producer waits up to 5 s
        K-->>AS: ack (offset)
        AS-->>U: 201 ActivityResponse
    end
    Note over AS,K: ack failure → 503 saved-but-not-queued<br/>activity is already in MongoDB · client retry may duplicate
    end

    rect rgb(250, 236, 252)
    Note over K,MR: PHASE 4 · ASYNC RECOMMENDATION — Kafka consumer
    K->>AI: deliver ActivityEvent (group=aiservice)
    Note right of AI: @KafkaListener · AckMode.RECORD<br/>failed record retried 2 s x3
    AI->>AI: RecommendationGenerator.generate(event)
    alt AI_API_KEY configured
        AI->>OAI: POST /v1/chat/completions
        OAI-->>AI: JSON recommendation
    else no key or provider error
        AI->>AI: rule-based fallback (provider=RULES)
    end
    AI->>MR: upsert by activityId (idempotent)
    MR-->>AI: saved Recommendation
    end

    rect rgb(240, 240, 240)
    Note over U,MR: PHASE 5 · READ RESULTS — JWT required on every call
    U->>AS: GET /api/activities/user/{userId}?page=0&size=20<br/>Bearer JWT
    AS->>MA: findByUserId(userId, pageable)
    MA-->>AS: Page of Activity
    AS-->>U: 200 Page of ActivityResponse
    U->>AI: GET /api/recommendations/user/{userId}?page=0&size=20<br/>Bearer JWT
    AI->>MR: findByUserId(userId, pageable)
    MR-->>AI: Page of Recommendation
    AI-->>U: 200 Page of RecommendationResponse
    U->>AI: GET /api/recommendations/activity/{activityId}<br/>Bearer JWT
    AI->>MR: findFirstByActivityIdOrderByCreatedAtDesc
    MR-->>AI: Recommendation
    AI-->>U: 200 RecommendationResponse
    end
